# Allowlist: everything is ignored unless it is listed below, so runtime data
# and secrets can never be committed by accident. To version a new file, add a
# line for it. Files inside a subfolder also need that folder's lines.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.dockerignore
!/.env.example
!/Dockerfile
!/README.md
!/compose.yaml
!/public/
!/seed.json
!/server.js
!/ts-config/

# Never version these, even inside allowed folders.
.env
*.key
*.pem
*secret*
*token*

# Private Betriebsnotizen (Homeserver, Firewall), nur lokal.
README.private.md
